flowchart LR
    Q[Current user question] --> A[Deterministic query analysis]
    Q --> E[One query embedding]
    E --> V[Vector candidate search]
    A --> L[Lexical candidate search]
    A --> M[Metadata document search]
    V --> F[Weighted reciprocal-rank fusion]
    L --> F
    M --> F
    F --> D[Deduplicated hybrid candidates]
    D --> R[Bounded model reranking]
    R --> K[Final Top-K evidence chunks]
    R -. failure or invalid output .-> H[Retain hybrid ordering]
    H --> K

    B[Owner + workspace + Ready + current embedding filters]:::guard -. applies .-> V
    B -. applies .-> L
    B -. applies .-> M
    classDef guard fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#31733b,color:#111;

